<title>USA: No damaging cold expected in Brazil coffee areas.</title>
<headline>No damaging cold expected in Brazil coffee areas.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGON, Mass. 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>No damaging cold is foreseen in Brazil's coffee regions, private forecaster Weather Services Corporation said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Temperatures are expected to be above normal today and Wednesday.</p>
</text>
